    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/56804fd5e618de9eb2effee86beef903.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/0a0da79bbdc4902149f7d5e941334e14.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Meet Valentine \u2013 the cutest chaos queen with enough slay for two!</strong> \u2728<br>You\u2019re trapped in a doll museum that\u2019s more horror than anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s time to tear those creepy dolls a new one and do your thing! \ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/90fa91c3061b72d68251bea384503d98.avif?t=1753446800\" width=1209 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find your way to freedom, you have to explore every exhibit \u2013 and not everything you discover will be pleasant. Watch out, because every little doll plays its own twisted game\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry, your personal tarot deck, matched to your zodiac sign and element, gives you the vibes and the extra boost to master all that horror with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/34294ee34394ba20f2fd852b3fdcfcbf.avif?t=1753446800\" width=1209 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your dark past, childhood trauma, and fight your way through a creepy doll nightmare \u2013 but of course, with plenty of cuteness and iconic attitude! Ready to slay that doll museum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s go, bestie. \ud83d\udc85</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f9da5bf0230964df71724c89c5682713.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Story Game with cute characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore spooky rooms and uncover little secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the cute cats hidden in the museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your tarot cards read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a reading based on your zodiac sign and element</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions about Valentine's fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from dangerous dolls and get revenge \u2013 or not, it's entirely up to you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1753446800\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the doll museum, or will you be doomed to live as a doll forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/56804fd5e618de9eb2effee86beef903.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/0a0da79bbdc4902149f7d5e941334e14.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Meet Valentine \u2013 the cutest chaos queen with enough slay for two!</strong> \u2728<br>You\u2019re trapped in a doll museum that\u2019s more horror than anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s time to tear those creepy dolls a new one and do your thing! \ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/90fa91c3061b72d68251bea384503d98.avif?t=1753446800\" width=1209 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find your way to freedom, you have to explore every exhibit \u2013 and not everything you discover will be pleasant. Watch out, because every little doll plays its own twisted game\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry, your personal tarot deck, matched to your zodiac sign and element, gives you the vibes and the extra boost to master all that horror with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/34294ee34394ba20f2fd852b3fdcfcbf.avif?t=1753446800\" width=1209 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your dark past, childhood trauma, and fight your way through a creepy doll nightmare \u2013 but of course, with plenty of cuteness and iconic attitude! Ready to slay that doll museum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s go, bestie. \ud83d\udc85</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f9da5bf0230964df71724c89c5682713.avif?t=1753446800\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Story Game with cute characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore spooky rooms and uncover little secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the cute cats hidden in the museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your tarot cards read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a reading based on your zodiac sign and element</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions about Valentine's fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from dangerous dolls and get revenge \u2013 or not, it's entirely up to you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1753446800\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the doll museum, or will you be doomed to live as a doll forever?</p>",
